README.md
# Institutional Signals

Institutional Signals represent observable events, conditions, metrics, or trends that describe the operational health of institutions within the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

Signals are dynamic.

Unlike entities (things) and relationships (connections), signals represent **institutional state**.

---

## Signal Domains

- Governance
- Procurement
- Capability
- Digital Public Infrastructure
- AI Governance
- Institutional Memory
- Interoperability
- Finance
- Risk
- Public Trust
- Competitiveness

---

## Signal Lifecycle

```
Observation

↓

Signal

↓

Assessment

↓

Recommendation

↓

Institutional Learning
